1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,821
Select a site on the map. Open Propose,

2
00:00:03,019 --> 00:00:04,319
then choose Block.

3
00:00:04,669 --> 00:00:08,860
Adjust the setback, building width and height. Choose

4
00:00:08,895 --> 00:00:12,041
whether that height is fixed, a maximum, or

5
00:00:12,099 --> 00:00:13,028
a range.

6
00:00:13,378 --> 00:00:15,305
Finish the design to place it on the

7
00:00:15,340 --> 00:00:15,932
map.

8
00:00:16,282 --> 00:00:19,301
Switch to 3D to inspect the proposed massing

9
00:00:19,393 --> 00:00:20,787
in its surroundings.

10
00:00:21,149 --> 00:00:24,307
Tilt, rotate and zoom to compare the building

11
00:00:24,620 --> 00:00:26,350
with the surrounding streets.
